{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40552","headline":"汉南邮亭 · 裴说","name":"汉南邮亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁水风清，开门日送迎。\n帆张独鸟起，乐奏大鱼惊。\n骤雨拖山过，微风拂面生。\n闲吟虽得句，留此谢多情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}